WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:05.310
So over the last couple of days, we've spent
some time going through the really shocking

00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:10.190
revelations that are made in Bob Woodward's
new book, Rage, including, of course, that

00:00:10.190 --> 00:00:15.379
Donald Trump all the way back in February
knew the seriousness of Corona virus, downplayed

00:00:15.379 --> 00:00:19.550
it publicly for political reasons, even though
he clearly knew.

00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:22.449
And now 200000 people nearly have died.

00:00:22.449 --> 00:00:24.450
And that is shocking.

00:00:24.450 --> 00:00:26.921
It's not an exaggeration to say that is a
shock.

00:00:26.921 --> 00:00:28.939
It is shocking that anybody would do that.

00:00:28.939 --> 00:00:33.110
Any human would do that regardless of their
motivations or their position.

00:00:33.110 --> 00:00:36.290
But our friend and he is our friend, he's
been on the show a couple of times.

00:00:36.290 --> 00:00:44.180
Steve Almond wrote a really good commentary
for WB You Are, which we are linking to.

00:00:44.180 --> 00:00:47.020
You can also check out my interviews with
Steve Almond.

00:00:47.020 --> 00:00:53.360
He wrote a really good op ed where he makes
the case that as ridiculous as as Donald Trump's

00:00:53.360 --> 00:00:59.990
actions are as shocking and outrageous and
immoral as it is that Donald Trump.

00:00:59.990 --> 00:01:04.580
Didn't just deceive about coronavirus, I mean,
he straight up lied, knowingly lied.

00:01:04.580 --> 00:01:06.690
He didn't just get it wrong, he lied.

00:01:06.690 --> 00:01:10.540
The real thing we should be horrified about.

00:01:10.540 --> 00:01:13.240
Is that it won't matter.

00:01:13.240 --> 00:01:15.520
And I actually agree with Steve Almond.

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:19.300
I've given this a lot of thought over the
last 24 hours.

00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:24.460
And yes, Donald Trump publicly said the virus
is under control.

00:01:24.460 --> 00:01:25.460
We shut it down.

00:01:25.460 --> 00:01:26.860
It's going to go away like a miracle.

00:01:26.860 --> 00:01:28.360
15 cases will soon be zero.

00:01:28.360 --> 00:01:30.620
All of it privately.

00:01:30.620 --> 00:01:32.450
He knew how serious it was.

00:01:32.450 --> 00:01:35.180
He believed that it was so contagious.

00:01:35.180 --> 00:01:37.350
In early February that it was spreading through
the air.

00:01:37.350 --> 00:01:39.040
And he said it to Bob Woodward.

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:40.700
And it's insane.

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:48.090
But as Steve Almond points out, the shock
is that Trump's support will likely not move

00:01:48.090 --> 00:01:49.210
as a result.

00:01:49.210 --> 00:01:54.340
This story will rage for some period of time,
just like early last week, early this week,

00:01:54.340 --> 00:01:58.160
late last week, rather, the troops are losers
and suckers.

00:01:58.160 --> 00:02:02.380
Story was raging just like the Ukraine story
did.

00:02:02.380 --> 00:02:03.380
Just like every story.

00:02:03.380 --> 00:02:06.600
And then something else will happen and things
will move on.

00:02:06.600 --> 00:02:11.840
And Donald Trump's approval will keep bouncing
between 39 and 47 percent.

00:02:11.840 --> 00:02:17.990
And ultimately, this election is going to
come down to not the country realizes, wow,

00:02:17.990 --> 00:02:19.500
this is bad.

00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:21.230
Hey, we're a laughing stock.

00:02:21.230 --> 00:02:22.500
Hey, this is a joke.

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:24.040
We have to stop this.

00:02:24.040 --> 00:02:31.920
This election, in the end, is going to come
down to can our turnout outdo their voter

00:02:31.920 --> 00:02:32.920
suppression?

00:02:32.920 --> 00:02:34.370
That is ultimately what this will be about.

00:02:34.370 --> 00:02:40.240
And if you want any proof of this, simply
spend some time checking out the posts over

00:02:40.240 --> 00:02:45.240
the last 48 hours in the typical pro Trump
on conclave's of the Internet.

00:02:45.240 --> 00:02:50.000
And what you will find is that over the last
48 hours, as the story exploded, first of

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:52.720
all, for the most part, the Trump is just
ignored it.

00:02:52.720 --> 00:02:54.910
They pretend the story doesn't exist.

00:02:54.910 --> 00:03:00.930
And then when it does come up, they either
say it's fake news or they assail someone's

00:03:00.930 --> 00:03:02.720
character like Bob Woodward.

00:03:02.720 --> 00:03:06.840
In this case, they will protect Trump at all
costs.

00:03:06.840 --> 00:03:12.050
The less involved ones will simply experience
cognitive dissonance and say it can't possibly

00:03:12.050 --> 00:03:13.410
be real.

00:03:13.410 --> 00:03:21.030
And almost every day it seems, certainly every
week there is a bombshell that would end other

00:03:21.030 --> 00:03:22.030
presidencies.

00:03:22.030 --> 00:03:23.860
It would they would have ended other presidencies.

00:03:23.860 --> 00:03:27.810
And I said this yesterday, and I think it
bears repeating, if the world really made

00:03:27.810 --> 00:03:28.810
sense.

00:03:28.810 --> 00:03:29.810
Trump never would have been elected.

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:30.810
Wouldn't be possible.

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:32.121
The public wouldn't be so stupid as to do
it.

00:03:32.121 --> 00:03:34.430
But it happened.

00:03:34.430 --> 00:03:38.160
If the world made a little more sense than
it does, Trump would have had to resign by

00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:39.160
now.

00:03:39.160 --> 00:03:42.560
But instead, Trump has a shot at four more
years.

00:03:42.560 --> 00:03:43.990
He really does.

00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:48.400
And the Republican Party, including Mitch
McConnell and friends McConnell and friends,

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:51.390
Mitch and friends, allowed this to happen.

00:03:51.390 --> 00:03:52.580
They could have intervened.

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:53.580
They could have removed Trump.

00:03:53.580 --> 00:03:55.510
They could have voted to convict on impeachment.

00:03:55.510 --> 00:03:57.770
They could have done any number of things.

00:03:57.770 --> 00:04:01.550
But they are also complicit and they need
to be punished as well.

00:04:01.550 --> 00:04:07.090
And hopefully some of them will be punished
by losing Martha McSally for one and others.

00:04:07.090 --> 00:04:09.629
But later, their punishment should come as
well.

00:04:09.629 --> 00:04:16.780
I keep thinking back to that speaker, that
woman at the DNC who spoke about her father,

00:04:16.780 --> 00:04:23.710
who died of coronavirus, who believed Trump
that it wasn't really serious.

00:04:23.710 --> 00:04:27.539
And she said, you know, it's kind of a cliche
line, but it but it is powerful in a sense

00:04:27.539 --> 00:04:28.539
as well.

00:04:28.539 --> 00:04:34.920
She said her father's only preexisting condition
before he died, before he got rotavirus, was

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:37.550
that he trusted Donald Trump.

00:04:37.550 --> 00:04:41.979
And meanwhile, Donald Trump has run counter
propaganda.

00:04:41.979 --> 00:04:46.069
We talked yesterday how now Donald Trump has
been nominated by some far right Norwegian

00:04:46.069 --> 00:04:50.740
politician for a Nobel Peace Prize, if you
can imagine something more outrageous.

00:04:50.740 --> 00:04:56.900
And he's been retweeting that and running
a counter narrative for a second step back.

00:04:56.900 --> 00:05:00.039
Come with me on this thought experiment, step
back.

00:05:00.039 --> 00:05:02.469
Imagine the worst thing Trump could possibly
do.

00:05:02.469 --> 00:05:03.619
Look at what?

00:05:03.619 --> 00:05:04.710
And what could it be?

00:05:04.710 --> 00:05:06.379
And then how would his base react?

00:05:06.379 --> 00:05:12.339
And you will realize that this Bob Woodward
fiasco is unlikely to have a huge impact.

00:05:12.339 --> 00:05:16.129
Imagine an audiotape of Trump Trump screaming
the N-word.

00:05:16.129 --> 00:05:21.900
Imagine a video of him with Putin talking
about a quid pro quo to win the election.

00:05:21.900 --> 00:05:25.349
Imagine a video of Trump committing sexual
assault or Trump's taxes come out.

00:05:25.349 --> 00:05:27.909
And it turns out, yeah, he's cheating on his
taxes.

00:05:27.909 --> 00:05:32.529
I still don't think it would matter to a large
portion of his base.

00:05:32.529 --> 00:05:38.719
Maybe maybe if Trump was on video saying the
people who voted me, they're suckers and idiots,

00:05:38.719 --> 00:05:40.699
I wouldn't be caught dead with them.

00:05:40.699 --> 00:05:43.729
I don't even like them at my clubs.

00:05:43.729 --> 00:05:45.099
Maybe that would make an impact.

00:05:45.099 --> 00:05:46.129
And I'm not even sure.

00:05:46.129 --> 00:05:51.189
I think even in that case, if Trump just straight
up insulted his followers, which he's done

00:05:51.189 --> 00:05:55.809
indirectly, but if he did it more directly,
I think most of them still say, you know,

00:05:55.809 --> 00:05:57.550
I don't need Trump to like me.

00:05:57.550 --> 00:05:59.800
I just need him to make America great.

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:04.419
And by the way, I'm sure he was talking about
somebody else, not me specifically.

00:06:04.419 --> 00:06:06.310
He wasn't talking about followers like me.

00:06:06.310 --> 00:06:10.870
He was talking about supporters like some
other people, even in that case.

00:06:10.870 --> 00:06:14.639
I struggle to see how it really affects Donald
Trump's approval.

00:06:14.639 --> 00:06:17.800
So check out Steve Oltmanns piece on WB.

00:06:17.800 --> 00:06:18.800
You are.

00:06:18.800 --> 00:06:21.490
We're linking to it about this.

00:06:21.490 --> 00:06:22.779
I think Steve is right.

00:06:22.779 --> 00:06:28.120
I think the real tragedy is that this isn't
going to hurt Trump in any kind of substantive

00:06:28.120 --> 00:07:41.499
way.

